No third-party asset is distributed with it. `mrbench assets fetch` downloads
robot descriptions from their upstream repositories at pinned commits, and
`mrbench assets looks` downloads table and floor textures and an HDRI from
Poly Haven (CC0), pinned by SHA-256; Isaac Sim loads the Franka Panda, the
room, a material and the YCB objects from NVIDIA's asset server. See CREDITS.md
for sources and licences.
